\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">is it wrong that my first thought was &quot;I am the terror that flaps in the night!&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not at all, the Avenger may be very theatrical.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T16:05:50-08:00","id":13024,"title":"","content":"Okay, I've been sharing this with all my friends today. This is some awesome stuff and I seriously love the art style more than is sane. Anyway, I just have a couple of questions for you.<br /> <br /> First, do you do character commissions in this same style? I need to have the group I GM rendered like this because ughhhh so good. <br /> Second isn't really a question so much as trying to see if you'll confirm or deny my thoughts on what some of these characters are. Captain Kobei, Dragonblood, yes? The gossamer avenger is probably a raksha, and I'm thinking the boar is infernal but honestly I'm not sure. Row though, I have no idea about. I mean, he obviously used essence in the fight with the boar, but if it's from a martial art I don't know which one, and if it's from a charm tree I don't know that either. Anyway, enough of my rambling.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://s67.photobucket.com/user/EggmanSizzle/media/Ex3KSBadge_zps950331e7.gif.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i67.photobucket.com/albums/h311/EggmanSizzle/Ex3KSBadge_zps950331e7.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"http://s67.photobucket.com/user/EggmanSizzle/media/BackerBadgesmall_zps424a0237.png.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i67.photobucket.com/albums/h311/EggmanSizzle/BackerBadgesmall_zps424a0237.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/846-eggmansizzle","name":"eggmansizzle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar846_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T17:38:18-08:00","id":13075,"title":"","content":"Hey, thank you very much!<br /> <br /> Unfortunately I won't be able to take commissions until mid December, I'm having a difficult time in school fill with any kinds of chores, and aside from HvSf I'm participating on a supplement as a side project. Fortunately! All these means that it is not a rock solid &quot;no&quot; and I'll just need to put order on my schedule to see how many cookies I can eat before the year ends. So I'll make the announcement here once I'm able to take commissions or I'll contact you by PM if you'd prefer.<br /> <br /> As for the other questions, you got most of them:<br /> <br /> Captain Kobei - Ryuujin (DB)<br /> The Gossamer Avenger - &quot;Raksha&quot;<br /> Lionboar... you'll find out<br /> Row - Mugen (Solar)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"ran