/div> </div> </div> </div>Where can I find these notes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T18:55:55-08:00","id":23446,"title":"","content":"Gonzo sent me an email, so now I can post my takes on some Strife characters.<br /> <br /> He didn't include any spoilers, though, so these will probably be proven wrong as the story goes on.<br /> <br /> Weapons are just flavour. None of these people uses a weapon-based martial art.<br /> <br /> <b>ROKRID THE BANDIT KING</b> [Mortal]<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Strength 3, Dexterity 3, Stamina 2<br /> <b>Techniques:</b> Basic Strike 4, Rush 4, Aerial Strike 2, Grapple 3, Block 4, Bite And Gouge 4, Kick In The Groin 4, Sand In Your Eyes 2<br /> <b>Backgrounds: </b>Minions (Bandits) 3, Resources 3, Fame 2, Contacts 1, Allies 1<br /> <b>Health Stocks:</b> 3<br /> <br /> <b>CAPTAIN KOBEI</b> [Earth Ryuujin][0xp]<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Strength 4, Dexterity 2, Stamina 4<br /> <b>Techniques:</b> Basic Strike 3, Rush 3, Aerial Strike 3, Grapple 3, Block 5, Front Kick 3, Rolling Axe Kick 4, Earthshock Strike 3, Earth Dragon Fang Koshinage 3, Overdrive Technique: As In The Beginning 2<br /> <b>Backgrounds: </b>Backing (Greyfalls) 4, Fame 1, Allies 1, Resources 1<br /> <b>Health Stocks:</b> 5","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":1154,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","user":"Sanctaphrax","date":". 12-09-2013, 07:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T20:30:37-08:00","id":23478,"title":"","content":"Wow, how did I miss this reminder on the new forum? And so many new pages! Lemme get my bib..<br /> <br /> *consumes*<br /> <br /> Awesome! Even more so than expected! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I mean, I'd liked this before, but reading 5 new comics in a row* made me enjoy it much more than I had been. Which I suppose doesn't surprise me: I had been grabbing every update as it came out, and I often like partaking of a large sitting of them. Just flows better to me that way. That may regrettably mean I only read this once a month or so, but have no doubt I'm adoring it!<br /> <br /> * The Halloween one counts! It references Okami!** In a way I find hilarious and also cool!<br /> ** Is it a &quot;subtle&quot; hint of Chief Lionboar's splat or a false lead? Could be either! Gonzo, you magnificent bastard!<br /> <br /> ... Ooooor the Gossamer Avenger being even more awesome than I'd hoped. ^__^ That could help, too. Go, Raksha Batman, go!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-04T20:54:13-08:00","id":23492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gaius</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/3080-webcomic-strife-s-back?p=23478#post23478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That may regrettably mean I only read this once a month or so, but have no doubt I'm adoring it!</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm planning on spending my winter vacations working on the comic to make faster updates in the future.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.c