s=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/3080-webcomic-strife-s-back?p=46288#post46288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure if the madman would fit a splat. He's very much a unique creature.</div> </div> </div> </div>I approve of having your own creations!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic","name":"Dragonmystic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T10:26:20-08:00","id":46338,"title":"","content":"(TOP SECRET HINT: From Lands of Creation: &quot;I AM is a thinking automaton of vast power, versatility and intelligence&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T12:39:41-08:00","id":50964,"title":"","content":"This week'll see <a href=\"http://bersagliere.deviantart.com/art/Can-t-touch-this-427353001?ga_submit_new=10%253A1389904693\" target=\"_blank\">some more strife</a>...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T19:16:36-08:00","id":54405,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.webcomic.ws/comics/31\" target=\"_blank\">New HvSf page! </a><br /> <br /> And I'm glad to announce that next week is HvSf's FIRST ANNIVERSARY!!! I never thought this would ever happen. Thank you all for your continued support.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T20:48:12-08:00","id":54455,"title":"","content":"Happy Anniversary, and best wishes for many more!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/91-wandering","name":"Wandering","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar91_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T21:03:15-08:00","id":54465,"title":"","content":"Very neat.<br /> <br /> Thinking mechanically...<br /> <br /> Untouchable Quantum Stance could impose a Clash penalty on characters who target you until someone manages to damage you. What kind of penalty I'm not sure...dice, being forced to reroll a success or two, and having to roll twice and take the worse result all come to mind. Not sure what the right power level would be.<br /> <br /> Position of Uncertainty Offense could let you use choose two Techniques next turn and decide which one to have used after all of the rolling is done. I really want to give Nocturnals an effect like that and PoUO seems like a suitable Technique to attach it to.<br /> <br /> Oaks to Acorns could be an Overdrive that reduces the target's Attributes to 1 after doing damage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/797631-why-craft-sucks-how-i-fixed-it\" target=\"_blank\">EX3 Craft Rewrite</a><br /> <br /> Sanctaphrax is not a person<br /> -Chejop Kejak","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1154-sanctaphrax","name":"Sanctaphrax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1154_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T21:23:24-08:00","id":54469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sanctaphrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/3080-webcomic-strife-s-back?p=54465#post54465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Very neat.<br /> <br /> Thinking mechanically...<br /> <br /> Untouchable Quantum Stance could impose a Clash penalty on characters who target you until someone manages to damage you. What kind of penalty I'm not sure...dice, being forced to reroll a success or two, and having to roll twice and take the worse result all come to mind. Not sure what the right power level would be.<br /> <br /> Position of Uncertainty Offense could let you use choose two Techniques next turn and decide which one to have used after all of the rolling is done. I really want to give Nocturnals an effect like that and PoUO seems like a suitable Technique to attach it to.<br /> <br /> Oaks to Acorns could be an Overdrive that reduces the target's Attributes to 1 after doing damage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those sound both great and fitting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T08:52:09-08:00","id":55477,"title":"","content":"I'm doing the 3e rewrite of Nocturnals, and even though I didn't recognize her as one until now, the abilities and &quot;nocturnal-ness&quot; abilities you throw to her is of particular interest to me.<br /> <br /> I can't promise anything, because mechanics come first, but if you demonstrate fitting and awesome abilities for her, I will try to work it in, so this conversation is relevant to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_l