chments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-19T20:52:57-07:00","id":116318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/3080-webcomic-strife-s-back?p=116064#post116064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which makes it absolutely hilarious that she has a crush on someone who fights for justice and refuses to kill. Ah, amore.</div> </div> </div> </div>She might be waiting for the perfect chance to kill him.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T22:07:43-07:00","id":124990,"title":"","content":"No new page yet, but here's a <a href=\"http://bersagliere.deviantart.com/art/Dueling-Dragons-451903147?ga_submit_new=10%253A1399179954&amp;ga_type=edit&amp;ga_changes=1&amp;ga_recent=1\" target=\"_blank\">little something</a> for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T19:24:47-07:00","id":137546,"title":"","content":"Hello people!<br /> <br /> The page drought is coming to an end. I have some free time, and I expect to upload new HvSf pages very soon.<br /> <br /> In the meantime, and as a token of my goodwill and gratitude to all of you who have been following the story so far, I bring you:<br /> <br /> <b>&quot;Gonzo's sketch factory RELOADED: <i>HvSf edition</i>&quot;</b><br /> <br /> Some time ago in the old WW forum I made character sketches for some forumites. It's time to open the factory once more! The rules are simple: give me a brief description of any of your characters. Some general traits (exalt type, caste, favorite weapon, etc), and in this case, a picture if you already have art of the character.<br /> <br /> I will choose THREE characters, and make a sketch of them in Heaven's Strife art style. I suggest that you submit characters with interesting traits, as it will be less likely to be chosen if his/her only defining characteristics are hair and robe color. Back in the old factory thread, I recieved very cool character concepts, and I'm sure years later it will be the same.<br /> <br /> So Heaven or Hell...<br /> <br /> Let's Rock!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T21:08:45-07:00","id":137661,"title":"","content":"I never actually got to play this character (he doesn't even have a name), but he was fabulous, so he'll make a return in EX3.<br /> <br /> He's a paunchy old Eclipse Caste of Southwestern extraction (kind of East Asian looking?), with a sizeable but well-groomed grey beard, dyed the blue-purple-red of a stormcloud at sunset. He wears an impressive turban and a fine silk coat (both lavender) over a simpler silk shirt and what are essentially hakama, matched with at least two sashes; despite his fine clothes, he is unshod.<br /> At his left hip hangs an exquisite and somewhat overlong drinking horn, and he carries a canesword and perhaps a flower. He is never seen without kohl around his eyes, nor the grim-faced ghost of a woman at his back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T22:12:25-07:00","id":137713,"title":"","content":"Have I told you you're awesome before? Because you're awesome.<br /> <br /> Ascendant Sword is a Chosen of Secrets from the Confederation of Rivers, with dark stringy hair and olive, heavily tanned skin (I always pictured him vaguely Hellenic/Middle Eastern). He wears what was once the robes of an Immaculate Monk, though it is ragged and torn from neglect. A essence-silk tunic serves as his armor, and is usually visible underneath his damaged robes. He wears a pale-blue prayer sash with an Immaculate rosary at his waist. He has tied a number of braids of various colors to his upper arms; all signifiers of his positions within or accomplishments for the Celestial Bureaucracy. Sword is a brawler, using a set of starmetal knuckle dusters as his preferred weaponry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T03:26:02-07:00","id":137952,"title":"","content":"This is the second character I've been playing for the longest, and as he accumulated new powers his design started to get a bit crazy (and perhaps not too conductive to the simpler format of the sketch)<br /> <br /> Hajime Ryugi is a sixteen-years old Chosen of Secrets and a student of the martial arts. He hails from Coral, which I'd decided was basically Japan, and as such is faux-Japanese in ethnicity. He is a short, wiry boy, with black hair that tends to get spiky. His clothing has a black-and-silver color scheme and is mismatched: he wears trousers made of some hard-looking material and metal boots (which have ridges, as if they were meant to be articulated), but a simple kimono vest sporting a logo made of a Z crossed with an I. He wears knee and elbow pads. Over the course of his adventures, he has acquired a considerable number of Hearthstones, and his outfit was specially modified to use them; he wears black fingerless gloves, each one holding a gem on the back of the hand, and two more on each side of his waist, placed roughly where one would holster a gun, a single one on his right elbow pad, and the last one is implanted in his back in a very Tony Stark fashion. He also has a pair of starmetal goggles which he keeps over his forehead at all times so he can lower them over his eyes when he needs Essence-sight.<br /> <br /> His appearance changes somewhat drastrically when in the middle of a fight, though. When going all out, his skin turns to orichalchum, he grows a final (bright red) hearthstone on his forehead as a third eye of sorts, and his sleeves get switfly shredded to reveal arms made of solid jade. He also has starmetal nails, but as they do not grow freakishly long as is the custom of the Prismatic Arrangement of Creation, they are not very visible, though they are surrounded by a sort of... fingertip-aura, so to speak. In this state, he also conjures mist and an absurd amount of cherry blossom flowing everywhere and periodically hiding him. He also dissolves into cherry blossoms and reforms from them, as if the cloud of petal was an extension of himself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":67,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","user":"Omicron","date":". 05-15-2014, 06:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T07:34:31-07:00","id":138037,"title":"","content":"Ah, cool!<br /> <br /> This is the character I've played for the longest time; a Slayer Caste by the name of Triumphant Sky. She hails from Lookshy, which I always assumed, made her somewhat Chinese in appearance. She has green hair, often in a bob cut, but due to her unwoven coadjulator being a Harpist, it has a mind of its own. <br /> <br /> She is usually dressed in a Malfean brass cuirass, a Gethin down undershirt, and baggy silk trousers, along with a colorful cloak and pointy toed shoes. She also usually has her mist razor daiklaive with her, being a sword-maiden of some repute. I designed this outfit specifically after hearing about the title of &quot;Demon Sultans&quot; that Infernals and CoCD: Malfeas use for Green Sun Princes, making me think of a garishly dressed superstar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T08:56:02-07:00","id":138101,"title":"","content":"Hmm, what about Marcus Agamnemon? The four-armed mutant panther-totem Full-Moon Lunar? From my first try at an<a href=\"http://www.manseofivy.com/agents-of-yu-shan/a0002\" target=\"_blank\"> Exalted Comic, Agents of Yu-Shan.</a><br /> <br /> I...never liked his outfit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/845-dragonmystic","name":"Dragonmystic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar845_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-15T12:31:16-07:00","id":138327,"title":"","content":"That's a mighty fine offer of you, Gonzo. Cheers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most 