ass=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/3080-webcomic-strife-s-back?p=254183#post254183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, and this year's Halloween special is also in my &quot;to do&quot; list. Last year it was Okami. Do you have any suggestions for this year's costumes?</div> </div> </div> </div>First choice: Persona 4.<br /> <br /> Second choice: Final Fantasy VII.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-07T10:16:51-08:00","id":305879,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://bersagliere.deviantart.com/art/Halloween-Special-2-493108709\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Special uploaded! </a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T08:34:29-08:00","id":314542,"title":"","content":"You know what time of the year it is?<br /> <br /> <b>&quot;Gonzo's sketch factory RELOADED: <i>HvSf edition 2</i>&quot;</b><br /> <br /> Time to open the factory once more! The rules are simple: give me a brief description of any of your characters. Some general traits (exalt type, caste, favorite weapon, etc), and in this case, a picture if you already have art of the character.<br /> <br /> The rules are pretty much the same:<br /> <br /> I will choose THREE characters, and make a sketch of them in Heaven's Strife art style. I suggest that you submit characters with interesting traits, as it will be less likely to be chosen if his/her only defining characteristics are hair and robe color. This time let's try to go for broke, so Exigent, Liminal, or even Getimian concepts will get special attention.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://bersagliere.deviantart.com/art/Character-sketches-455340482\" target=\"_blank\">You can see the previous edition's sketches here.</a><br /> <br /> So Heaven or Hell...<br /> <br /> Let's Rock! <br /> \u00a1Viva la Revoluci\u00f3n!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":90,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","user":"Gonzo","date":". 11-17-2014, 11:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T08:43:03-08:00","id":314549,"title":"","content":"I would like to submit Rose Razor, Night Caste Solar. She has a middle-eastern look to her, but always keeps her head and most of her body covered in red coverings - reddish scale armor, a pareo, trousers, a cloak, and a veil over the lower part of her face. She always carries an artifact sword and dagger.<br /> <br /> Here's a picture by another artist: <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/post/90019029212/rose-razor-night-caste-solar-x-a\" target=\"_blank\">http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.c...aste-solar-x-a</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T09:35:01-08:00","id":314628,"title":"","content":"I will submit Iron Reed, a Chosen of Journeys.<br /> <br /> He is a wiry man who hails from Icehome. He typically ties his long greying hair back in a tail, and wears a small pair of spectacles. He normally wears long baggy pants, heavy boots and a long wool pea coat. He favors the Reaper Daiklaive in battle, and is only rarely seen without a heavy Starmetal case thrown over his shoulder; his artifact folding ship, the <i>Mela's Tears</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T13:18:47-08:00","id":314793,"title":"","content":"There's still time, so don't hesitate to submit characters you want to see sketched by yours truly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T08:27:17-08:00","id":315419,"title":"","content":"Bumping in case somebody interested missed this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T09:27:35-08:00","id":315477,"title":"","content":"I'll submit Obsidian Oak, the Three Legged Dragon<br /> <br /> He's an old and muscular Earth-Aspected Dragon-Blooded wearing monk outfits and a blindfold. He was horribly scarred from a firewand shot in the face during a battle, losing his sight, and lost his right arm as punishment for failure. He has an unkempt beard but shaves his head everyday in a ritualistic fashion. His favored weapons are his legs but he usually keeps a Mancala board strapped to his belt. He fights using Earth awareness and War charms.<br /> <br /> As for the image, I have tried to whip up something quickly using the Monk from Diablo 3. Not exactly what I had in mind but a good general idea. <a href=\"http://imgur.com/pDfWq9B\" target=\"_blank\">http://imgur.com/pDfWq9B</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T10:14:11-08:00","id":315505,"title":"","content":"I'm probably not going to be able to use her anytime soon, maybe you'll get a kick out of her?<br /> <br /> Bastille, Liminal Exalted Flesh Aspect<br /> <br /> <b>Bio:</b><br /> A bounty hunter with a reputation for collecting &quot;trophies&quot; from her victims with a wide arsenal of looted tools and weapons. When not on the hunt Bastille wears a very cold and professional demeanour that\u2019s been known to slip when she\u2019s caught up in the heat of the moment or the thrill of the chase.<br /> <b>Appearance:</b><br /> Bastille has grey blue eyes and long blonde hair but her most prominent feature are the sutures which runs across the bridge of her nose and divides her attractive face into two halves the lower half of which is slightly paler than the top half. Her current weapons of choice are a crossbow that\u2019s been modified to incorporate a windlass, a short sword with which she\u2019s demonstrated a talent for pinning live targets like butterflies and her personal favourite a great black mastiff that she considers a kindred spirit.<br /> <b>Skills:</b><br /> Bastille\u2019s most extensive modification to herself is a second vestigial heart that can provide huge bursts of adrenaline. She can trap ghosts in solid objects, stab or shoot through people with astonishingly little damage and her spine is much more flexible than it should be.<br /> <b>Other notes:</b><br /> -She\u2019s still thinking of a name for her dog<br /> -She talks with a southern drawl<br /> -Her earliest memories are of the salt mines where she was created, but she\u2019s very vague on the who or why<br /> -I lost the ref-pic, sorry!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":7,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","user":"Lioness","date":". 11-18-2014, 01:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","ava