"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/3080-webcomic-strife-s-back?p=818605#post818605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, I'm doing some concept art and I'm in need of some help.<br /> <br /> Which of the following three signature characters would you prefer to see in future HvSf pages, either as a cameo, a parody or an &quot;important&quot; role? You can even choose to distribute the previous categories (cameo, parody and role) between them.<br /> <br /> -The Lady of Darkness in Bloodstained Boobs.. er I mean Robes<br /> -Madame Perv... I mean Vert<br /> -Thousand Faceted Nelumbo (sorry I found no joke here)<br /> <br /> The three are characters that aesthetically are not very... complex? They're some of the most naked characters in the game, and I'm trying to visually reconceptualize any of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love Madame Vert.<br /> <br /> As somebody who prefers not to wear clothes whenever I get the chance, I sympathize with her &quot;I have scales, what the hell do I need pants for&quot; outlook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wi