n form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-10T13:10:15-07:00","id":966881,"title":"","content":"Hey guys, I just wanted to share with you the reason I'm not posting more comics.<br /> <br /> My PC broke down, and I fear I might have lost a lot of info with it, including the comics. This makes me kinda sad, and angry at the same time. I'll try to fix it this weekend, but if the worst happens... well... I don't know if I'll be able to re-draw all the stuff that got lost.<br /> <br /> If you're reading this, I'm guessing you are interested in Heaven's Strife, and you deserve to know what's happening on the production side of things.<br /> <br /> Thank you all!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T05:34:36-07:00","id":967277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/3080-webcomic-strife-s-back?p=966881#post966881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey guys, I just wanted to share with you the reason I'm not posting more comics.<br /> <br /> My PC broke down, and I fear I might have lost a lot of info with it, including the comics. This makes me kinda sad, and angry at the same time. I'll try to fix it this weekend, but if the worst happens... well... I don't know if I'll be able to re-draw all the stuff that got lost.<br /> <br /> If you're reading this, I'm guessing you are interested in Heaven's Strife, and you deserve to know what's happening on the production side of things.<br /> <br /> Thank you all!</div> </div> </div> </div>Owch. That happened to a friend of mine (my Avatar-drawing buddy). This won't help you with recovery, but in the future you might want to try using an external hard drive or a cloud storage site for backups. Better yet, use both for redundancy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T05:57:56-07:00","id":967280,"title":"","content":"That is sad news!<br /> <br /> Just remember that you can easily recover the information on your hard drive, if that is the main problem, as that is not usually the part that breaks.<br /> <br /> Hope you get things sorted out! K6BD and Heaven\u00b4s Strife are the comics that I read online, so it would be sad indeed to see it go!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T20:27:19-07:00","id":996975,"title":"","content":"New Halloween Special!!!<br /> <br /> Happy Day of the Dead everyone!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.webcomic.ws/files/sp-hw-16.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-02T09:02:53-07:00","id":997177,"title":"","content":"Oh my god, someone else remembers Chaos Legion?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"