 tell you that you can still follow this webcomic here:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://tapas.io/series/Heavenly-Strife\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://tapas.io/series/Heavenly-Strife\" target=\"_blank\"> Tapas: Stories You Crave </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://tapas.io/series/Heavenly-Strife\" target=\"_blank\"> https://tapas.io/series/Heavenly-Strife </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> webcomics, onilne comics, visual stories, graphic novels, webcomic, online comic, novels, webnovels, diverse webcomics, bite-sized stories, tapastic </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-18T13:16:39-07:00","id":1457133,"title":"","content":"Back on track!<br /> <br /> One of the reasons I took so long to update the comic was that I have finally decided to make Heavenly Strife an &quot;inspired by Exalted&quot; webcomic, and it will no longer be situated in Creation. The reason for this is that, although this webcomic was originally based on the Burn Legend shard, I no longer see the need to keep the connection with it. I changed so many things for the setting that I feel like it is its own thing right now. It will always carry a heavy influence of the game, but I haven't played Exalted for years now, and my personal opinion is that Ex3 isn't very popular right now, so I would prefer to share the effort of making this comic with a wider audience from now on.<br /> <br /> I will always be grateful for the support from those of you who followed the original Heaven's Strife on comicfury, and even more to those who subscribed and commented on some of the published pages. I'm gonna try my best to reinvigorate the story and characters, and I know you will always be able to trace their exalted roots. I hope you stay and give me the chance to present to you a new version of this comic.<br /> <br /> Follow Heavenly Strife here: <a href=\"https://tapas.io/series/Heavenly-Strife/info\" target=\"_blank\">https://tapas.io/series/Heavenly-Strife/info</a><br /> <br /> If you like my art style, be sure to subscribe! Let's hit our first goal of subscribers!<br /> <br /> The strife returns with a mighty roar, thank you guys!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/3b96d9f9-66de-47de-9647-866be86fc670/depeozy-1024ca8e-85bc-425d-a175-54c8d98466ea.png/v1/fill/w_1024,h_1024,q_80,strp/hs5_panel_6_by_bersagliere_depeozy-fullview.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..TpP2HPT4so4OZFfaAVlXFKxEAy1bGnwLKJzPeKgwnOs\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/3b96d9f9-66de-47de-9647-866be86fc670/depeozy-1024ca8e-85bc-425d-a175-54c8d98466ea.png/v1/fill/w_1024,h_1024,q_80,strp/hs5_panel_6_by_bersagliere_depeozy-fullview.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..TpP2HPT4so4OZFfaAVlXFKxEAy1bGnwLKJzPeKgwnOs\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""}